  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727335989792808/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"360\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pollen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/974426112312627321/requires_pollen.svg\" alt=\"網站\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.discord.gg/VzXSCFp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/440256241932173323?label=&amp;color=b7765d&amp;labelColor=d10a30&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=b7765d&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.twitter.com/teamauroramods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/teamauroramods?label=&amp;color=b7765d&amp;labelColor=d10a30&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;logoColor=b7765d&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/Available for_383725_all(d10a30-b7765d-fff-b7765d).svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727336233066546/divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🍄 蘑菇作為新型木材！<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enhanced Mushrooms 將 Minecraft 的巨大蘑菇轉化為新型木材，力求與地獄真菌保持一致。此模組還對現有的蘑菇內容進行了調整，旨在使蘑菇地更適宜居住，並協助您進行與蘑菇相關的建築。<br><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></p><ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2 種<strong>新型木材套組</strong>，每種對應各自的蘑菇類型</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EM 蘑菇莖將取代普通蘑菇莖，包括自然生長和使用骨粉催生時</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">調整原版蘑菇方塊的掉落表，旨在使其可再生並鼓勵種植</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原版蘑菇方塊現在具有特殊的剝皮功能，為建築師增添獨特用途</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一系列<strong>跨模組兼容性</strong>，主要針對 Farmer's Delight 和 Moonflower 模組（1.18+）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EM 還包含一個材質包，提供主世界和地獄真菌的替代紋理</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul><p><img style=\"text-align:center\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727336233066546/divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🔨 兼容性：<br></strong></span>EM 的總體目標是與其他模組良好協作。以下是當前支持的模組列表；請注意，此列表可能會隨時間變化。&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.18 及以上版本：<br></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Farmer's Delight</strong></a> - 蘑菇木材類型的櫥櫃和切割配方</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Carpenter</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<em>計劃中</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Foundations</strong> -&nbsp;<em>計劃中</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Quark</strong>&nbsp; -&nbsp;<em>計劃中，最高優先級</em></span></li>\n</ul><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.16 及以下版本</strong><strong>：<br></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quark</strong> </a>-&nbsp; 木材變種及發光蘑菇的新木材套組（當功能啟用時）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Buzzier Bees</strong></a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;蜂箱變種</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-boats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Extra Boats</strong></a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;每種新木材套組的船類型</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>我可以將此模組加入我的模組包嗎？&nbsp;</strong>答案永遠是肯定的，無需詢問許可！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727336233066546/divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/974082409463181333/image_1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/974082409802895430/image_2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727336233066546/divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252faurora\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/862763334126665743/862765690775404604/TeamAurora_-_MC_Graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"250/\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/973727206620659722/973727336233066546/divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>",
